{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "weather 采集器输出契约(扁平标量·全字符串;键不带 prefix)",
  "description": "D1..D7 为 7 天槽位;温度/天气/曲线均为字符串,band.inc 直接引用。字段只增不删。",
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "City",
    "Provider"
  ],
